{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SalesQuotes\">Sales Quotes</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Pending\">Pending</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Is On Pending Quote Quotes RecurringSalesQuote RecurringSalesQuotes Sales SalesQuote SalesQuotes To ToDate\">The <strong>Pending Sales Quotes</strong> screen displays <em>recurring sales quotes</em> that are due to be created based on their schedules.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And By Is Quote Quotes Rate RecurringSalesQuote RecurringSalesQuotes Sales SalesQuote SalesQuotes To ToDate\">This screen helps you manage and process <em>recurring sales quotes</em> efficiently by showing which quotes need to be generated.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Actual And Create Custom Customer Customers Is On Pending Quote Quotes Rate Sales SalesQuote SalesQuotes To ToDate View\">Review the list of pending quotes and click <strong>Create</strong> to generate the actual <em>sales quotes</em> for your customers.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Date Is Quote Rate RecurringSalesQuote Sales SalesQuote To ToDate\">Displays the scheduled date when the <em>recurring sales quote</em> will be automatically generated as a new <em>sales quote</em>.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Custom Customer From FromDate Is Quote Rate Sales SalesQuote To ToDate\">Displays the <em>customer</em> who will receive the generated <em>sales quote</em> when it is created from the recurring template.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Content Description From FromDate On Quote RecurringSalesQuote Sales SalesQuote\">Shows the description from the <em>recurring sales quote</em> template that helps identify the content and purpose of the quote.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "pending-sales-quotes"
